{"agent":"lane-xa-spawn-plan","data":{"budget":"15 min, no model spend, no agent started","claim":"A pure planner over (descriptor [headless] else a shipped fact table read from `claude --help` 2.1.323 and `kilo run --help` 7.8.27) yields `claude -p <brief> --output-format json --model M --effort E --max-budget-usd N --permission-mode P` and `kilo run <brief> --format json --model M --dir D [--variant E] [--auto]`.","falsifier":"`claude --help` lacking --model/--effort/--max-budget-usd/--permission-mode, or `kilo run --help` lacking --model/--dir/--format/--variant/--auto, or the planner spawning any process.","item":"XA-spawn-plan","mechanism":"Both binaries document these flags in --help (free, read-only); ddflow already has the descriptor v2 [headless] shape (grok, vibe) so the planner reads that first and falls back to a table; planning builds a list and runs nothing.","probe":"claude --help | grep -E -- '--(model|effort|max-budget-usd|permission-mode)'; kilo run --help | grep -E -- '--(model|dir|format|variant|auto)'; pytest tests/test_spawn_plan.py -k \"starts_no_worker\"","probe_output":"claude 2.1.323: --effort <level> (low, medium, high, xhigh, max); --max-budget-usd <amount> (only with --print); --model <model>; --permission-mode <mode> (acceptEdits, auto, bypassPermissions, manual, dontAsk, plan); NO --max-turns listed. kilo 7.8.27 run: -m/--model provider/model; --dir; --format default|json; --variant (reasoning effort); --auto; NO budget flag. Planning test: 26 passed in tests/test_spawn_plan.py (no worker process started; Popen guard asserts).","question":"Can `ddflow spawn --plan` return the exact argv for a claude and a kilo worker from facts read off the installed binaries, with no process started and no model called?","sources":["claude --help (2.1.323)","kilo run --help (7.8.27)"],"verdict":"CONFIRMED"},"id":"ede9f44790c9558dd31d50ada","kind":"research.recorded","lamport":200256,"schema":1,"subject":"R4b55295491","ts":"2026-11-14T13:25:30.293834Z"